In the matter of: 
An application under Section 115(1) of the Code of Civil 
Procedure. 
  
And 
Mahmuda Begum and others 
  
 
 
.... Petitioners 
  
-Versus- 
Maifuza Akhter and others 
  
 
 
…. Opposite parties 
