IN THE SUPREME COURT OF BANGLADESH 
 
 
 
 
   HIGH COURT DIVISION 
 
 
        (CIVIL REVISIONAL JURISDICTION) 
 
 
 
Civil Revision No. 1161 of 2024 
 
 
 
 
 
In the matter of: 
 
Md. Robiul Islam and others. 
 
 
...Petitioners. 
 
 
 
 
 
-Vs- 
Farida Yeasmin and others. 
 
 
....Opposite parties. 
 
 
 
 
Mr. Zainul Abedin, Sr. Adv. with 
Mr. J.K. Paul, Adv. with 
 
 
 
