Being 
aggrieved, 
the 
plaintiff-opposite 
parties, 
as 
appellants, preferred Civil Appeal No.13 of 2019 before District 
Judge, Barguna. Eventually, the learned Additional District 
Judge, 
Barguna, 
by 
the 
Judgment 
and 
decree 
dated 
07.03.2023, allowed the appeal after setting aside the Judgment 
