None appears to contest the rule. 
Mrs. Purabi Saha learned Advocate for the petitioners upon placing 
the relevant provisions of rules incorporated under chapter 7 of the Rules, 
1955 submits that the Appellate Officer has not been given any power 
whatsoever to re-hear the appeal cases afresh which have already been 
