38 
of 
the 
Town 
Improvement Act, 1953 (in brief, ""the act 
1953""), may proceed to frame an improvement 
scheme. 
Section 42 of the Act 1953 provides for 
the re-housing of persons displaced by an 
improvement scheme which runs as follows: 

<<PAGE 8>>
8 
 
""42. 
The 
Kartripakkha 
may 
frame 
schemes 
(herein 
called 
re-housing 
schemes) 
for 
the 
construction, 
